Skills Registry — Licensing Overview
====================================

This repository is a curated registry that aggregates third-party AI agent
skills alongside original registry tooling. Licensing applies as follows:

1. Registry tooling and original content
   The registry tooling in `scripts/` and `hooks/`, the catalog metadata in
   `catalog/`, and any future original skills under `skills/lettucebo/` are
   licensed under the MIT License (below).

2. Vendored third-party skills
   Every skill vendored under `skills/<source>/` (other than
   `skills/lettucebo/`) retains its own upstream license. Per-skill terms are
   provided in each skill's own `LICENSE.txt` where present. See the `NOTICE`
   file for provenance and license mapping per source and per skill.

3. Restricted skills
   `skills/claude/docx`, `skills/claude/pdf`, `skills/claude/pptx`, and
   `skills/claude/xlsx` are governed by proprietary Anthropic terms, are marked
   `redistributable: false` in the catalog, and are NOT relicensed under the MIT
   License below. Their terms live in each skill's `LICENSE.txt`.

Nothing in this file relicenses third-party content. The MIT License below
applies only to the registry tooling and original content described in item 1.

